5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I worry about external dependencies. We need to check what we can actually control.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I’m excited to see how this helps our neighbors. Who can we reach?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,I’ve seen budgets look fine now and fail later. We must check the funding shape.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,We always judge new ideas by their sound. I want to see the old records.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I’m a bit nervous. I just want to make sure we don’t overwork the staff.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,Agreed. We should look at past timetables and supplier reliability.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
