12,1,2,talk,George,,I’ll look into the grant terms and the running costs from last year.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,I want to see the attendance sheets and the two old programmes.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I think we should check the volunteer register and the evening bookings.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Yes, those seem like the right starting points for us.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"Thanks, everyone. I’m glad we’re all thinking about the community.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,It is important to be thorough. I will review the financial documents.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,I hope the data tells the truth this time.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,Okay. I will try to look into those things carefully.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,Let’s proceed with the investigation.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I can’t wait to see what we find!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
